At Wed, 5 Sep 2007 08:38:44 -0700,
Andrew Morton wrote:
> 
> > On Wed, 22 Aug 2007 23:29:02 +0100 Roger Gammans <roger@computer-surgery.co.uk> wrote:
> > Hi
